      "description": "Fires per DEVICE on a syslog message of severity 0-2 (emergencies, alerts, critical): IOS writes severity as the digit in the mnemonic. Severity 3 is not alerted: SMART_LIC-3-COMM_FAILED recurs by design (D4 gives the lab no route to Cisco). The device is the origin-id after the sequence number, as the heartbeat rules read it; the stream's host label is the collector. No data is the healthy state (C166, C168).",
